SUMMARY:IMPACT PRO SERIES I: Old Worlds\, New Voices
DESCRIPTION:NCCMI Faculty and NC Symphony Musicians present music by Glinka\, Brahms and NC-based composer Chrissy Ricker. \nMore info about the concert can be found here. \nWhile there is no charge for admission\, there is a suggested donation of $20. Registration for seat reservation can be completed here. \nThe concert will also be recorded and streamed on the NCCMI YouTube Channel on Sunday\, November 8 at 7 pm.
